Saphira virtualisation group
==============================

Installing this package installs a working Saphira virtualisation
host stack: QEMU host emulation plus libvirt management (which in
turn pulls its own storage, network and firmware helpers).

This package carries no payload of its own beyond this file. The
authoritative member list is the `depends` field of this package's
APK metadata (`apk info -a saphira-virtualisation`). Profiles and
image definitions must name the group, never re-enumerate its
closure: no QEMU/libvirt plumbing knowledge belongs outside APK
metadata.
